    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but i want to dig a bit deeper into the \"why\" behind those. \n\nlike, for olumide in lagos, why would \"vibrant and energetic\" be better for a fintech app specifically? wouldn't a more conservative, \"serious\" look work better for someone handling business finances? and for zaid in dubai, are u saying that a high-net-worth user there wouldn't appreciate a clean, minimalist tech look like we'd use for connor? i just want to make sure we aren't leaning too hard into tropes vs actual usability requirements for those regions.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
